From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:32:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! test(v2): regenerate chain fixtures for the
 legacy-coinbase regtest chain

Update the StakeContenderId vector for the current regtest genesis. Independently derive SHA256d(LE32 genesis hash || LE32 proof ID); the frozen Python control records input bytes and resulting2abd5e94... ID. Focused staking4cases pass; production identity code is unchanged.

Tier: V2
---
 src/avalanche/test/stakingrewards_tests.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/avalanche/test/stakingrewards_tests.cpp b/src/avalanche/test/stakingrewards_tests.cpp
index a81eb48660..49396358a5 100644
--- a/src/avalanche/test/stakingrewards_tests.cpp
+++ b/src/avalanche/test/stakingrewards_tests.cpp
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@ BOOST_FIXTURE_TEST_CASE(stakecontender_computeid, TestChain100Setup) {
     ProofId proofid1 = ProofId::fromHex(
         "979dbc3b1351ee12f91f537e04e61fdf93a73d5ebfc317bccd12643b8be87b02");
     BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(
-        "3a6d3ded7ca5ac807c83806beb8d766cc14d98fdb70cbded5e9e85bc1950f7e7",
+        "2abd5e94e03fa1152b86ec7adcfe4ee3993e5026513f1870faf77d796c01a286",
         StakeContenderId(chaintip->GetAncestor(0)->GetBlockHash(), proofid1)
             .ToString());
 
